# Contact form (Web3Forms) --------------------------------------------------
# Public access key for the contact form. Web3Forms emails you each submission;
# this key is safe to expose in the browser (that's how Web3Forms works).
#
# Setup:
#   1. Get a free key at https://web3forms.com (enter your email, copy the key).
#   2. Copy this file to .env.local:   cp .env.local.example .env.local
#   3. Paste your key after the =      (no quotes, no spaces).
#   4. Restart the dev server.
#
# On Vercel/Netlify, add NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY as an environment variable
# in the project settings instead of committing .env.local.
#
# Until this is set, the form falls back to opening the visitor's email app.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
